        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.774,
            0.556,
            0.845
          ],
          "content": "Why did we use metal wires for making electric circuits? Can we not use some other materials for wires?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.435,
            0.873,
            0.696,
            0.926
          ],
          "content": "Also, why are electric wires covered with plastic or rubber?"
        },
